_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/syntaxerror247","id":176927541,"node_id":"U_kgDOCouzNQ","login":"syntaxerror247","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/syntaxerror247"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742#pullrequestreview-2947807177","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107742","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-21T16:15:04Z"},{"id":2948035805,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vt3Td","state":"APPROVED","commit_id":"2f4c3d411c7b9bdb10c7bc0e746a161ce7b60f26","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/41921395?u=74caa4e396a8e2995ac648a80f7488601d679e63&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Alex2782","id":41921395,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQxOTIxMzk1","login":"Alex2782","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alex2782"},"body":"Looks good! Tested on `Pixel 8a` - Android 16\r\n\r\n\r\n<details> <summary>Suggestions:</summary>\r\n\r\n--------------\r\n\r\n- mention in the documentation that `edge_to_edge` does not support every device\r\n- Reference to the Android documentation, there are probably few users who even know what this is https://developer.android.com/develop/ui/views/layout/edge-to-edge\r\n- Is it possible to change `edge_to_edge` at runtime?\r\n\r\n------------\r\n\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_displayserver.html#class-displayserver-method-window-set-mode\r\n\r\n- `WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN = 3` **without** `edge_to_edge`?\r\n- `WINDOW_MODE_EXCLUSIVE_FULLSCREEN = 4` **with**  `edge_to_edge`?\r\n\r\n-------------------\r\n\r\n- In the `Window Management` demo, I was also able to change `Immersive Mode` at runtime. Perhaps the export settings could be removed(?) if it works at runtime and can be changed via the project settings.\r\n\r\n\r\n```gdscript\r\nfunc _on_button_fullscreen_pressed() -> void:\r\n\tif DisplayServer.window_get_mode() == DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN:\r\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_WINDOWED)\r\n\telse:\r\n\t\tDisplayServer.window_set_mode(DisplayServer.WINDOW_MODE_FULLSCREEN)\r\n\r\n```\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/8e64d20a-8daf-46a3-9528-238bb936e009)\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1178903a-d6d0-4e7d-9bf0-6b72c1765c6c)\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n</details>\r\n","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107742#pullrequestreview-2948035805","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107742","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2025-06-22T01:46:42Z"}]